{"id":"f055a57b277b371e","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/077_G_3_c_相继式演算.md","title":"077 G 3 c 相继式演算","display":"077_G_3_c_相继式演算","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-G3c-命题语言\">1. G3c 命题语言</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Prop=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(Prop=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。公式构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"atm,neg,and,or,imp\">\\(atm,neg,and,or,imp\\)</span>。公式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Frm_{G3c}\">\\(Frm_{G3c}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in Prop\">\\(p\\in Prop\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"atm(p)\\in Frm_{G3c}\">\\(atm(p)\\in Frm_{G3c}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in Frm_{G3c}\">\\(A\\in Frm_{G3c}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"neg(A)\\in Frm_{G3c}\">\\(neg(A)\\in Frm_{G3c}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_{G3c}\">\\(A,B\\in Frm_{G3c}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"and(A,B)\\in Frm_{G3c}\">\\(and(A,B)\\in Frm_{G3c}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_{G3c}\">\\(A,B\\in Frm_{G3c}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"or(A,B)\\in Frm_{G3c}\">\\(or(A,B)\\in Frm_{G3c}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_{G3c}\">\\(A,B\\in Frm_{G3c}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"imp(A,B)\\in Frm_{G3c}\">\\(imp(A,B)\\in Frm_{G3c}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>本系统的目标差异为：相继式后件是有限多重集，因此这是经典多结论 G3c；结构规则不作为原始规则出现，收缩和弱化吸收到上下文参数中。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式操作\">2. 公式操作</h1>\n<p>变元函数满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"PV(atm(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad PV(neg(A))=PV(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[PV(atm(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad PV(neg(A))=PV(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"PV(and(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[PV(and(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"PV(or(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[PV(or(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"PV(imp(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[PV(imp(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命题替换集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_{G3c}=\\{\\sigma:Prop\\to Frm_{G3c}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_{G3c}=\\{\\sigma:Prop\\to Frm_{G3c}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命题替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in Sub_{G3c}\">\\(\\sigma\\in Sub_{G3c}\\)</span> 的扩张满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(atm(p))=\\sigma(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(atm(p))=\\sigma(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(neg(A))=neg(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(neg(A))=neg(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(and(A,B))=and(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(and(A,B))=and(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(or(A,B))=or(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(or(A,B))=or(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(imp(A,B))=imp(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(imp(A,B))=imp(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价是字面相等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-G3c-相继式\">3. G3c 相继式</h1>\n<p>上下文集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ctx_{G3c}=\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_{G3c}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ctx_{G3c}=\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_{G3c}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>相继式集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Seq_{G3c}=Ctx_{G3c}\\times Ctx_{G3c}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Seq_{G3c}=Ctx_{G3c}\\times Ctx_{G3c}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>写作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\">\\(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\)</span>。G3c 不把弱化、收缩、交换列为原始规则；上下文参数直接出现在每条逻辑规则中。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-初始相继式\">4. 初始相继式</h1>\n<p>G3c 初始关系只使用原子公式：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Init_{G3c}\n=\n\\{\\Gamma,atm(p)\\Rightarrow atm(p),\\Delta:\np\\in Prop,\\ \\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_{G3c})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Init_{G3c}\n=\n\\{\\Gamma,atm(p)\\Rightarrow atm(p),\\Delta:\np\\in Prop,\\ \\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_{G3c})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{G3c}=Init_{G3c}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{G3c}=Init_{G3c}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-否定与合取规则\">5. 否定与合取规则</h1>\n<p>否定规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\neg L}^{G3c}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,\\Delta,\\Gamma,neg(A)\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\neg L}^{G3c}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,\\Delta,\\Gamma,neg(A)\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\neg R}^{G3c}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow\\Delta,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow neg(A),\\Delta)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\neg R}^{G3c}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow\\Delta,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow neg(A),\\Delta)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>合取规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\wedge L}^{G3c}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A,B\\Rightarrow\\Delta,\\Gamma,and(A,B)\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\wedge L}^{G3c}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A,B\\Rightarrow\\Delta,\\Gamma,and(A,B)\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\wedge R}^{G3c}\n=\n\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,\\Delta,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow B,\\Delta),\\Gamma\\Rightarrow and(A,B),\\Delta)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\wedge R}^{G3c}\n=\n\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,\\Delta,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow B,\\Delta),\\Gamma\\Rightarrow and(A,B),\\Delta)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-析取与蕴含规则\">6. 析取与蕴含规则</h1>\n<p>析取规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\vee L}^{G3c}\n=\n\\{((\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow\\Delta,\\Gamma,B\\Rightarrow\\Delta),\\Gamma,or(A,B)\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\vee L}^{G3c}\n=\n\\{((\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow\\Delta,\\Gamma,B\\Rightarrow\\Delta),\\Gamma,or(A,B)\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\vee R}^{G3c}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,B,\\Delta,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow or(A,B),\\Delta)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\vee R}^{G3c}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,B,\\Delta,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow or(A,B),\\Delta)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>蕴含规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\to L}^{G3c}\n=\n\\{((\\Gamma,imp(A,B)\\Rightarrow A,\\Delta,\\Gamma,B\\Rightarrow\\Delta),\\Gamma,imp(A,B)\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\to L}^{G3c}\n=\n\\{((\\Gamma,imp(A,B)\\Rightarrow A,\\Delta,\\Gamma,B\\Rightarrow\\Delta),\\Gamma,imp(A,B)\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\to R}^{G3c}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow B,\\Delta,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow imp(A,B),\\Delta)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\to R}^{G3c}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow B,\\Delta,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow imp(A,B),\\Delta)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以上每个规则集合均是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Seq_{G3c}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times Seq_{G3c}\">\\(Seq_{G3c}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times Seq_{G3c}\\)</span> 的子集，且集合中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Frm_{G3c}\">\\(Frm_{G3c}\\)</span> 中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Pi,\\Lambda\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Pi,\\Lambda\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Ctx_{G3c}\">\\(Ctx_{G3c}\\)</span> 中。定义总规则关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{G3c}\n=\nRule_{\\neg L}^{G3c}\\cup Rule_{\\neg R}^{G3c}\n\\cup Rule_{\\wedge L}^{G3c}\\cup Rule_{\\wedge R}^{G3c}\n\\cup Rule_{\\vee L}^{G3c}\\cup Rule_{\\vee R}^{G3c}\n\\cup Rule_{\\to L}^{G3c}\\cup Rule_{\\to R}^{G3c}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{G3c}\n=\nRule_{\\neg L}^{G3c}\\cup Rule_{\\neg R}^{G3c}\n\\cup Rule_{\\wedge L}^{G3c}\\cup Rule_{\\wedge R}^{G3c}\n\\cup Rule_{\\vee L}^{G3c}\\cup Rule_{\\vee R}^{G3c}\n\\cup Rule_{\\to L}^{G3c}\\cup Rule_{\\to R}^{G3c}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-G3c-推导树\">7. G3c 推导树</h1>\n<p>G3c 推导树由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tree}_{G3c}\">\\(\\operatorname{Tree}_{G3c}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{G3c}\">\\(\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{G3c}\\)</span> 刻画。可用规则仅为第 5、6 节列出的逻辑规则；没有原始弱化、收缩、交换或割规则。</p>\n<p>定义有限路径、根树、子节点和叶节点：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec}(q,u,v)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(k&gt;0\\land q:k\\to\\{u,v\\}\\cup\\operatorname{dom}(\\prec)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\prec)\n\\land q(0)=u\\land q(k-1)=v\n\\land \\forall i+1&lt;k\\ q(i)\\prec q(i+1)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec}(q,u,v)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(k&gt;0\\land q:k\\to\\{u,v\\}\\cup\\operatorname{dom}(\\prec)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\prec)\n\\land q(0)=u\\land q(k-1)=v\n\\land \\forall i+1&lt;k\\ q(i)\\prec q(i+1)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RootedTree}(N,r,\\prec)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\prec\\subseteq N\\times N\\land r\\in N\n\\land \\forall n\\in N\\,\\exists!q\\,\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec}(q,r,n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RootedTree}(N,r,\\prec)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\prec\\subseteq N\\times N\\land r\\in N\n\\land \\forall n\\in N\\,\\exists!q\\,\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec}(q,r,n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\{m\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\prec)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\prec):n\\prec m\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec}(n)\\Longleftrightarrow \\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\{m\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\prec)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\prec):n\\prec m\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec}(n)\\Longleftrightarrow \\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tree}_{G3c}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nN\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathbb N\\land r\\in N\\land\n\\operatorname{RootedTree}(N,r,\\prec)\\land \\lambda:N\\to Seq_{G3c}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Tree}_{G3c}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nN\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathbb N\\land r\\in N\\land\n\\operatorname{RootedTree}(N,r,\\prec)\\land \\lambda:N\\to Seq_{G3c}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{G3c}(N,\\prec,\\lambda,n)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec}(n)\\land\\lambda(n)\\in Ax_{G3c})\n\\lor\n\\exists m\\,(\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\{m\\}\\land ((\\lambda(m)),\\lambda(n))\\in Rule_{G3c})\n\\lor\n\\exists m_0,m_1\\,(\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\{m_0,m_1\\}\\land ((\\lambda(m_0),\\lambda(m_1)),\\lambda(n))\\in Rule_{G3c}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{G3c}(N,\\prec,\\lambda,n)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec}(n)\\land\\lambda(n)\\in Ax_{G3c})\n\\lor\n\\exists m\\,(\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\{m\\}\\land ((\\lambda(m)),\\lambda(n))\\in Rule_{G3c})\n\\lor\n\\exists m_0,m_1\\,(\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\{m_0,m_1\\}\\land ((\\lambda(m_0),\\lambda(m_1)),\\lambda(n))\\in Rule_{G3c}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Der}_{G3c}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Tree}_{G3c}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\\land\n\\forall n\\in N\\ \\operatorname{NodeOK}_{G3c}(N,\\prec,\\lambda,n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Der}_{G3c}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Tree}_{G3c}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\\land\n\\forall n\\in N\\ \\operatorname{NodeOK}_{G3c}(N,\\prec,\\lambda,n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可导关系\">8. 可导关系</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{G3c}\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists N\\,\\exists r\\,\\exists\\prec\\,\\exists\\lambda\\,\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Der}_{G3c}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\\land\n\\operatorname{RootLab}_{G3c}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)=\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vdash_{G3c}\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists N\\,\\exists r\\,\\exists\\prec\\,\\exists\\lambda\\,\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Der}_{G3c}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\\land\n\\operatorname{RootLab}_{G3c}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)=\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RootLab}_{G3c}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)=\\lambda(r),\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{G3c}=\\{\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\in Seq_{G3c}:\\vdash_{G3c}\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RootLab}_{G3c}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)=\\lambda(r),\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{G3c}=\\{\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\in Seq_{G3c}:\\vdash_{G3c}\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>目标区分对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{G3c}=(Seq_{G3c},Rule_{G3c},\\operatorname{Der}_{G3c},\\mathsf{Cn}_{G3c}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_{G3c}=(Seq_{G3c},Rule_{G3c},\\operatorname{Der}_{G3c},\\mathsf{Cn}_{G3c}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-整个形式系统\">9. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{G3c}\n=\n\\bigl(\nProp,\nFrm_{G3c},\nPV,\nSub_{G3c},\n\\widehat\\sigma,\nCtx_{G3c},\nSeq_{G3c},\nInit_{G3c},\nAx_{G3c},\nRule_{\\neg L}^{G3c},\nRule_{\\neg R}^{G3c},\nRule_{\\wedge L}^{G3c},\nRule_{\\wedge R}^{G3c},\nRule_{\\vee L}^{G3c},\nRule_{\\vee R}^{G3c},\nRule_{\\to L}^{G3c},\nRule_{\\to R}^{G3c},\nRule_{G3c},\n\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{RootedTree},\n\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{Tree}_{G3c},\n\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{G3c},\n\\operatorname{Der}_{G3c},\n\\operatorname{RootLab}_{G3c},\n\\vdash_{G3c},\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{G3c},\n\\Delta_{G3c}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{G3c}\n=\n\\bigl(\nProp,\nFrm_{G3c},\nPV,\nSub_{G3c},\n\\widehat\\sigma,\nCtx_{G3c},\nSeq_{G3c},\nInit_{G3c},\nAx_{G3c},\nRule_{\\neg L}^{G3c},\nRule_{\\neg R}^{G3c},\nRule_{\\wedge L}^{G3c},\nRule_{\\wedge R}^{G3c},\nRule_{\\vee L}^{G3c},\nRule_{\\vee R}^{G3c},\nRule_{\\to L}^{G3c},\nRule_{\\to R}^{G3c},\nRule_{G3c},\n\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{RootedTree},\n\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{Tree}_{G3c},\n\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{G3c},\n\\operatorname{Der}_{G3c},\n\\operatorname{RootLab}_{G3c},\n\\vdash_{G3c},\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{G3c},\n\\Delta_{G3c}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含 G3c 的原子初始相继式和上下文内置的经典左右规则；不含原始结构规则、割规则、量词规则或结构解释。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-G3c-命题语言","text":"1. G3c 命题语言","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式操作","text":"2. 公式操作","level":1},{"id":"3.-G3c-相继式","text":"3. G3c 相继式","level":1},{"id":"4.-初始相继式","text":"4. 初始相继式","level":1},{"id":"5.-否定与合取规则","text":"5. 否定与合取规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-析取与蕴含规则","text":"6. 析取与蕴含规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-G3c-推导树","text":"7. G3c 推导树","level":1},{"id":"8.-可导关系","text":"8. 可导关系","level":1},{"id":"9.-整个形式系统","text":"9. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"Prop=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"atm,neg,and,or,imp","display":false},{"tex":"Frm_{G3c}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in Prop","display":false},{"tex":"atm(p)\\in Frm_{G3c}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in Frm_{G3c}","display":false},{"tex":"neg(A)\\in Frm_{G3c}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in Frm_{G3c}","display":false},{"tex":"and(A,B)\\in Frm_{G3c}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in Frm_{G3c}","display":false},{"tex":"or(A,B)\\in Frm_{G3c}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in Frm_{G3c}","display":false},{"tex":"imp(A,B)\\in Frm_{G3c}","display":false},{"tex":"PV(atm(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad PV(neg(A))=PV(A),","display":true},{"tex":"PV(and(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B),","display":true},{"tex":"PV(or(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B),","display":true},{"tex":"PV(imp(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B).","display":true},{"tex":"Sub_{G3c}=\\{\\sigma:Prop\\to Frm_{G3c}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in Sub_{G3c}","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat\\sigma(atm(p))=\\sigma(p),","display":true},{"tex":"\\widehat\\sigma(neg(A))=neg(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),","display":true},{"tex":"\\widehat\\sigma(and(A,B))=and(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),","display":true},{"tex":"\\widehat\\sigma(or(A,B))=or(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),","display":true},{"tex":"\\widehat\\sigma(imp(A,B))=imp(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"Ctx_{G3c}=\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_{G3c}).","display":true},{"tex":"Seq_{G3c}=Ctx_{G3c}\\tim